+- Scripts in `.mjs`, configuration in YAML
+- Output in `output/` (gitignored), Reports in `reports/`
+- JDs in `jds/` (referenced as `local:jds/{file}` in pipeline.md)
+- Batch in `batch/` (gitignored except scripts and prompt)
