+|----------|-----|---------|
+| German | `modes/de/` | DACH (Germany, Austria, Switzerland) |
+| French | `modes/fr/` | France, Belgium, Switzerland, Luxembourg, Quebec |
+| Japanese | `modes/ja/` | Japan |
