+# Cover letter — Oregon DAS z/OS Systems Administrator (ISS 8), REQ-196649
+
+**Posting:** [z/OS Systems Administrator](https://oregon.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/SOR_External_Career_Site/job/Salem--DAS--State-Data-Center/z-OS-Systems-Administrator--Information-Systems-Specialist-8-_REQ-196649?q=developer) — Enterprise Information Services, Data Center Services  
