+# Cover letter — Oregon ODOT Senior Database Administrator (ISS 8), REQ-200017
+
+**Posting:** [Senior Database Administrator](https://oregon.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/SOR_External_Career_Site/job/Salem--ODOT--Transportation-Building/Senior-Database-Administrator_REQ-200017) — Oregon Department of Transportation  
