+
+**Posting:** [Senior Applications Developer](https://oregon.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/SOR_External_Career_Site/job/Salem--DAS--Executive-Building/Senior-Applications-Developer--Information-Systems-Specialist-8-_REQ-199700) — Department of Administrative Services, Office of the State Controller  
