+services in Oregon</p>
+<hr />
+<h2 id="executive-summary">Executive Summary</h2>
+<p>The site has a strong human story (faith-driven values, honest
+pricing, family-owned) but is currently optimized like a generic Wix
+template, not a local HVAC business. The biggest issues are a generic
+page title, weak keyword-focused headings, thin service content, no
+city-level targeting, and missing technical SEO basics (sitemap,
+schema).</p>
+<p><strong>Current SEO estimate:</strong> 4/10<br />
+<strong>Achievable with fixes below:</strong> 7/10+ (no full redesign
+required)</p>
+<hr />
+<h2 id="critical-fixes-do-these-first">Critical Fixes (Do These
+First)</h2>
+<h3 id="fix-the-page-title">1. Fix the Page Title</h3>
+<p><strong>Current:</strong> <code>HOME | My Site 1</code></p>
+<p><strong>Problem:</strong> Google and searchers see a placeholder
+title. This hurts rankings and click-through rate.</p>
+<p><strong>Recommended titles (pick one based on actual service
+area):</strong></p>
+<ul>
+<li><code>HVAC Ministries | Heating &amp; Cooling Services in Oregon</code></li>
+<li><code>HVAC Ministries | HVAC Repair &amp; Installation in Salem, OR</code>
+<em>(if Salem is primary market)</em></li>
+</ul>
+<p><strong>Where to fix:</strong> Wix → Pages → Home → SEO / Page
+Settings → Title tag</p>
+<hr />
+<h3 id="add-a-meta-description">2. Add a Meta Description</h3>
+<p><strong>Current:</strong> Likely missing or auto-generated.</p>
+<p><strong>Recommended copy:</strong></p>
+<blockquote>
+<p>HVAC Ministries provides honest heating, cooling, ductwork,
+installation, repair, and maintenance services for Oregon families. Call
+503-385-1432 for service or a free estimate.</p>
+</blockquote>
+<p><strong>Where to fix:</strong> Wix → Pages → Home → SEO → Meta
+description (keep under ~155 characters)</p>
+<hr />
+<h3 id="fix-the-main-headline-h1">3. Fix the Main Headline (H1)</h3>
+<p><strong>Current:</strong> Fragmented headings — “COMFORT / YOU CAN
+TRUST / SERVICE / WITH A PURPOSE”</p>
+<p><strong>Problem:</strong> Emotionally strong but weak for search.
+Google looks for a clear H1 with service + location keywords.</p>
+<p><strong>Recommended structure:</strong></p>
+<ul>
+<li><strong>H1:</strong>
+<code>Reliable HVAC Repair and Installation in Oregon</code></li>
+<li>Keep tagline below as supporting copy: <em>“Comfort you can trust.
+Service with a purpose.”</em></li>
+</ul>
+<hr />
+<h3 id="fix-typo-in-cta">4. Fix Typo in CTA</h3>
+<p><strong>Current:</strong> <code>GET A FREE ESTMATE</code><br />
+<strong>Fix to:</strong> <code>GET A FREE ESTIMATE</code></p>
+<hr />
+<h3 id="create-separate-service-pages">5. Create Separate Service
+Pages</h3>
+<p><strong>Current:</strong> All services listed on homepage only.</p>
+<p><strong>Problem:</strong> One page cannot rank well for multiple
+service keywords (AC repair, heating installation, ductwork, etc.).</p>
+<p><strong>Create these pages:</strong></p>
+<table>
+<thead>
+<tr>
+<th>URL slug (suggested)</th>
+<th>Page title</th>
+</tr>
+</thead>
+<tbody>
+<tr>
+<td><code>/hvac-installation</code></td>
+<td>New HVAC System Installation in Oregon</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>/ac-repair</code></td>
+<td>Air Conditioning Repair in Oregon</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>/heating-repair</code></td>
+<td>Heating System Repair in Oregon</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>/ductwork</code></td>
+<td>Whole-House Ductwork Services</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>/hvac-maintenance</code></td>
+<td>HVAC Maintenance &amp; Tune-Ups</td>
+</tr>
+<tr>
+<td><code>/retrofit-hvac-systems</code></td>
+<td>HVAC System Retrofitting</td>
+</tr>
+</tbody>
+</table>
+<p><strong>Each page should include:</strong></p>
+<ul>
+<li>500–900 words of unique content</li>
+<li>Local keywords (Oregon + cities served)</li>
+<li>2–4 FAQs</li>
+<li>Photos with alt text</li>
+<li>Clear CTA (Book Service / Free Estimate)</li>
+<li>Phone number: 503-385-1432</li>
+</ul>
+<hr />
+<h2 id="local-seo">Local SEO</h2>
+<h3 id="add-specific-service-area-keywords">6. Add Specific Service Area
+Keywords</h3>
+<p><strong>Current:</strong> “Local Oregon HVAC Operator” — too
+vague.</p>
+<p><strong>Add to homepage and contact/footer:</strong></p>
+<blockquote>
+<p>Serving Salem, Keizer, Albany, Woodburn, Silverton, Stayton, and
+surrounding Oregon communities.</p>
+</blockquote>
+<p><strong>Important:</strong> Only list cities/counties you actually
+serve.</p>
+<h3 id="consistent-nap-name-address-phone">7. Consistent NAP (Name,
+Address, Phone)</h3>
+<p>Display clearly in footer and contact section on every page:</p>
+<pre><code>HVAC Ministries LLC
+Phone: 503-385-1432
+Email: divineairandhome@gmail.com
+CCB: 236663
+Service Area: [list cities/counties]</code></pre>
+<p>Use the <strong>exact same</strong> business name, phone, and email
+everywhere (website, Google Business Profile, directories).</p>
+<h3 id="google-business-profile">8. Google Business Profile</h3>
+<p>For a local HVAC company, Google Business Profile often matters
+<strong>more than the website</strong> for “near me” searches.</p>
+<p><strong>Action items:</strong></p>
+<ul>
+<li>Claim or verify listing for HVAC Ministries LLC</li>
+<li>Add all services (installation, repair, maintenance, ductwork,
