+<li>Upload before/after photos, team photos, truck/logo</li>
+<li>Add business hours</li>
+<li>Set service area</li>
+<li>Ask satisfied customers for Google reviews</li>
+<li>Post updates periodically (seasonal tips, promotions)</li>
+</ul>
